kanon 1

# The same post header in canonical English, with no language layer loaded — the proof,
# in the site itself, that the language is neither Portuguese nor legal.
#
# Kanon has no English language layer, so a date is written the way the neutral core
# writes it: `2026-05-06`. `construir.jl` loads this model in an environment without
# `locale`, and the Portuguese formatters (`corrente`, `extenso`) do not exist here.

data
  titulo     : text       !
  descricao  : text
  imagem     : text
  autor      : autor      !
  data       : date       !
  atualizado : date
  serie      : text
  tags       : text[1..]
  traducao   : chamada

text

: titulo
# {titulo}

: imagem
[!\[{titulo}\](<{imagem}>)]

: descricao
[*{descricao}*]

: assinatura
By **{autor}**, {data}[; updated {atualizado}].

: serie
[Part of the series *{serie}*.]

: traducao
[Also in Portuguese: \[{traducao}\](<{traducao.url}>).]

: corpo
<!-- corpo -->

: etiquetas
[Tags: {tags}.]
